; iter_empty_skip: an ITER over an empty slice must skip its body, the
; same way RANGE with count <= 0 does. Counter stays 0.
;
; Paired with range_empty_skip below, which is the same shape under the
; other loop opener.

VECI r0
PUSH 1
VECPUSH r0
PUSH 2
VECPUSH r0

PUSH 0
STOW r1

PUSH 1           ; start_idx
PUSH 1           ; end_idx (start >= end -> empty)
ITER r0
LOAD r1
INC
STOW r1
NEXT

PUSH 0
OUTPUT r1
HALT
